00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.800
We can set our
connectivity, private IP,

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.630
public IP-- all of that.

00:08:00.630 --> 00:08:01.760
We can change the size.

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.250
